=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Hieronymus.
* Travel to the Beastman Ensign at (G-12) in {z:Grauberg}.
** Once the party leader interacts with it and selects to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* Two parties of {m:Quadavs|Quadav} (2x {m:Quadav Guard}, 1x {m:Quadav Carrier}) will start moving slowly in different directions. The objective of this mission is to kill all 6 {m:Quadavs|Quadav} before they reach the end of their route.
** The Carriers run off shortly after engaging in combat / when reduced to low HP, so you'll need to kill them quickly.
** Should a {m:Carrier|Quadav Carrier} make it to the end of the area (which is quite large), the mission is failed.
* Once all six {m:Quadavs|Quadav} are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** You must exit area by **using the Twilight Aureola** for {n:Hieronymus} to acknowledge the mission as successful!
* Return to {n:Hieronymus} for your reward.

